{"availability":"available","full":"GOODBOY008/labelize","name":"labelize","description":"Fast Rust engine to parse ZPL, EPL & TSPL/TSC label data and render to PNG/PDF. CLI tool, HTTP microservice, or library. Open-source Labelary alternative.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":75,"forks":30,"created":"2026-03-18T06:29:59Z","updated":"2026-10-19T23:38:53Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://labelize.764629910.workers.dev","topics":["barcode","cli","code128","datamatrix","epl","label-generator","label-printer","labelary","microservice","pdf","pdf417","png","qrcode","rust","shipping-label","thermal-printer","tsc","tspl","zebra","zpl"],"demo":"https://labelize.764629910.workers.dev/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.651Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.651Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.651Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:28.161Z","stars":72,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:58.622Z","stars":72,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:43:24.910Z","stars":72,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:03:21.896Z","stars":73,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-09T18:00:57.750Z","stars":73,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-11T09:02:12.844Z","stars":73,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:01:44.037Z","stars":74,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-16T18:01:17.788Z","stars":74,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.651Z","stars":75,"forks":30}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Parse and render ZPL / EPL / TSPL labels to PNG & PDF — fast, offline, open source.","🌐 Playground · 📚 Tutorials · 📜 Changelog · 🚀 Releases","Labelize is a Rust engine that parses ZPL (Zebra Programming Language), EPL (Eltron Programming Language), and TSPL/TSC label data and renders it to PNG or PDF — no printer hardware required. The same engine ships as a CLI tool, an HTTP microservice, a WebAssembly package, an Android library, and a plain Rust crate, producing identical output on every surface."],"features":["🖨️ 38+ ZPL commands — text & fonts, 12 barcode symbologies (Code 128, EAN-13/8, UPC-A/E, Code 39, Interleaved 2-of-5, PDF417, Aztec, DataMatrix, QR, MaxiCode), boxes/circles/diagonals/ellipses, graphic fields, stored…","🏷️ EPL2 support — text, the full 1D/2D barcode command set (B/b), lines, diagonals, boxes, binary graphics (GW)","🖼️ PNG & PDF output — thermal-faithful 1-bit monochrome by default, optional antialiased greyscale","🔤 Embedded fonts — zero runtime font dependencies (Roboto Condensed, DejaVu Sans Mono, ZPL GS — all permissively licensed)","⚡ 5 ms per render — no network, no interpreter, no printer"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GOODBOY008/labelize/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cac0e1a7318638cf0cb989f91b0f7e04f75288473bf51458534bcb8b372aa5f2","extractedAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.793Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.793Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Parse and render ZPL / EPL / TSPL labels to PNG & PDF — fast, offline, open source.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GOODBOY008/labelize/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"cac0e1a7318638cf0cb989f91b0f7e04f75288473bf51458534bcb8b372aa5f2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GOODBOY008/labelize/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.794Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-19T23:38:53Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.651Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:45:11.174Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GOODBOY008/labelize/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.795Z","hash":"cac0e1a7318638cf0cb989f91b0f7e04f75288473bf51458534bcb8b372aa5f2","originalBytes":18023,"storedBytes":18023,"truncated":false},"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T10:32:27.692Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v1.7.0","tag":"v1.7.0","publishedAt":"2026-10-04T07:31:37Z","url":"https://github.com/GOODBOY008/labelize/releases/tag/v1.7.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T10:32:27.692Z","screens